WEBVTT

00:00:10.650 --> 00:00:13.110
I wonder how Yuki is doing.

00:00:13.540 --> 00:00:15.780
He must have already reached Kamakura.

00:00:16.390 --> 00:00:19.620
He's probably meeting with
Takashiro-sama around now.

00:00:20.250 --> 00:00:24.290
What will Yuki-chan think
if he learns about the past?

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:28.470
I'm sure Takashiro-san is suffering, too.

00:00:28.470 --> 00:00:32.890
But as the one who has borne
this burden alone till now,

00:00:32.890 --> 00:00:35.130
he has to tell him everything.

00:00:35.570 --> 00:00:40.180
But Yuki-chan makes others'
suffering his own!

00:00:40.180 --> 00:00:45.390
He takes on their pain,
hurting himself in the process.

00:00:46.750 --> 00:00:49.780
Things will only get harder for Yuki.

00:00:49.780 --> 00:00:52.190
What are you guys crying about?

00:00:52.190 --> 00:00:55.490
If he's determined to take
on everyone else's pain,

00:00:55.490 --> 00:00:57.660
we just need to ensure that
we don't have any problems.

00:00:58.470 --> 00:00:59.370
Hotsuma.

00:00:59.370 --> 00:01:04.000
We decided to protect him.

00:01:22.280 --> 00:01:25.770
Only I know your pain...

00:01:26.520 --> 00:01:28.270
Your uncertainty...

00:01:28.850 --> 00:01:31.260
Your loneliness...

00:01:32.250 --> 00:01:36.480
If only we could be together forever.

00:01:37.940 --> 00:01:42.740
I'll say it as many times as you wish.

00:01:50.860 --> 00:01:53.000
I will not betray you!

00:03:32.950 --> 00:03:37.990
Frozen Time

00:03:45.080 --> 00:03:49.370
You've changed since I last saw you.

00:03:50.090 --> 00:03:52.880
You seem to have arrived prepared.

00:03:58.790 --> 00:04:00.060
Yuki?

00:04:00.900 --> 00:04:01.980
Yes?

00:04:04.560 --> 00:04:06.190
Yuki!

00:04:07.030 --> 00:04:10.650
You've grown so much!

00:04:10.780 --> 00:04:13.250
And I can't believe how cute you are!

00:04:13.250 --> 00:04:15.530
I could kiss you!

00:04:15.730 --> 00:04:18.380
Come on! Stop being so shy and look at me!

00:04:18.380 --> 00:04:19.750
W-Wait...

00:04:19.750 --> 00:04:22.000
Tsubaki-san, what are you doing?

00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:24.680
You shouldn't do that. You'll get in trouble.

00:04:24.680 --> 00:04:27.600
No one asked you, Masamune.

00:04:27.600 --> 00:04:30.280
Tsubaki-san, I thought you hated men.

00:04:30.280 --> 00:04:32.280
This one's different.

00:04:33.230 --> 00:04:35.550
He's so cute...

00:04:36.690 --> 00:04:39.440
That's quite a warm welcome, Tsubaki.

00:04:39.440 --> 00:04:42.100
But you should let go of Yuki.

00:04:42.100 --> 00:04:43.770
You're scaring him.

00:04:45.620 --> 00:04:47.560
T-Takashiro-san, uh...

00:04:47.560 --> 00:04:50.150
This is Shikibe Tsubaki.

00:04:50.150 --> 00:04:51.570
She's Ibuki's younger sister.

00:04:51.570 --> 00:04:52.650
Ibuki-san's sister?

00:04:52.650 --> 00:04:54.130
Nice to meet you.

00:04:54.130 --> 00:04:57.530
And I look after this guy, Masamune.

00:04:57.530 --> 00:05:00.350
What's with the unenthusiastic introduction?

00:05:01.240 --> 00:05:03.680
I'm Shinmei Masamune.

00:05:03.680 --> 00:05:07.990
I'm an apprentice necromancer,
training here as a guard.

00:05:07.990 --> 00:05:09.980
I'm also only seventeen.

00:05:09.980 --> 00:05:11.090
Nice to meet you!

00:05:11.090 --> 00:05:12.960
N-Nice to meet you.

00:05:12.960 --> 00:05:16.760
I've been looking forward to meeting you.

00:05:16.760 --> 00:05:19.890
Takashiro-sama's been teasing me
about it this whole time.

00:05:19.890 --> 00:05:22.010
H-Hey, Tsubaki-san...

00:05:22.010 --> 00:05:24.100
Sorry, Tsubaki.

00:05:24.100 --> 00:05:27.600
But you'll have to wait a little longer.

00:05:29.210 --> 00:05:31.770
Shall we go out into the garden, Yuki?

00:05:40.370 --> 00:05:43.900
I'm sorry for asking you here
so soon after your recovery.

00:05:43.900 --> 00:05:45.320
You must be tired.

00:05:45.320 --> 00:05:50.040
No. But Takashiro-san, you don't look well.

00:05:50.610 --> 00:05:54.250
Are those injuries you suffered...

00:05:55.010 --> 00:06:00.220
Currently, my diet's restricted,
as prescribed in preparation for a ritual.

00:06:04.190 --> 00:06:07.740
Don't worry. Nothing's wrong with me.

00:06:16.390 --> 00:06:17.400
Amazing.

00:06:18.050 --> 00:06:21.020
What is this? I've seen this place before.

00:06:21.020 --> 00:06:24.790
I feel like I've known about it for ages.

00:06:31.920 --> 00:06:33.060
Yuki...

00:06:41.010 --> 00:06:42.970
Takashiro-san!

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:46.690
I'm all right. Don't worry.

00:06:46.690 --> 00:06:47.720
But...

00:06:58.350 --> 00:06:59.960
His wound...

00:07:03.620 --> 00:07:06.210
I suppose you would find it strange.

00:07:06.210 --> 00:07:10.510
As far as you've known, you're the
only one with healing abilities.

00:07:16.650 --> 00:07:19.130
But this wound will never heal.

00:07:19.910 --> 00:07:22.680
A family member inflicted it,

00:07:22.680 --> 00:07:27.100
before I could finish casting the Lost Spell.

00:07:27.960 --> 00:07:29.690
It symbolizes my guilt.

00:07:31.740 --> 00:07:33.140
Guilt...

00:07:33.140 --> 00:07:38.030
The Lost Spell's forbidden magic

00:07:38.030 --> 00:07:43.540
grants immortality to those
who carry Duras inside them.

00:07:43.540 --> 00:07:45.020
Duras?

00:07:45.880 --> 00:07:49.200
Takashiro-san, you can't mean...

00:07:50.040 --> 00:07:54.290
I carry a Duras inside my body.

00:07:55.500 --> 00:07:59.700
Unlike the rest of you, I
have not been reborn.

00:07:59.700 --> 00:08:07.470
Since the Setting of Taurus,
I have lived more than a thousand years.

00:08:17.860 --> 00:08:18.950
Here you are.

00:08:18.950 --> 00:08:19.820
Thank you.

00:08:20.160 --> 00:08:23.030
You must be tired.
Perhaps you'd like to rest?

00:08:23.030 --> 00:08:27.340
I'm fine. I'll just wait for Yuki-kun to come back.

00:08:29.600 --> 00:08:31.860
That hits the spot...

00:08:31.860 --> 00:08:35.470
It tastes just like Aya-chan's tea.

00:08:35.470 --> 00:08:39.900
Before I sent her to the Twilight Mansion,
I made sure she could make it.

00:08:39.900 --> 00:08:44.010
Thorough as always, Fuyutoki-kun.

00:08:44.010 --> 00:08:46.760
No wonder the boss relies
on you so heavily.

00:08:47.810 --> 00:08:52.180
No, he depends on no one.

00:08:53.180 --> 00:08:55.600
He would never allow himself to do that.

00:08:56.610 --> 00:09:02.610
Having to carry all sorts of responsibilities,
without a single complaint...

00:09:03.580 --> 00:09:08.010
As the one who knows everything,

00:09:09.320 --> 00:09:11.510
he chose that path for himself.

00:09:13.490 --> 00:09:16.260
The Duras that lives inside me

00:09:16.260 --> 00:09:21.260
continually regenerates
every cell in my body.

00:09:21.260 --> 00:09:25.210
He restores my memory, as well.

00:09:25.210 --> 00:09:28.020
I cannot forget anything.

00:09:28.020 --> 00:09:30.120
That's terrible...

00:09:30.120 --> 00:09:33.560
But why would you do it?

00:09:34.130 --> 00:09:38.340
Because we need my vast experience
and knowledge

00:09:38.340 --> 00:09:42.320
just to stand a chance against
them in this fight.

00:09:42.320 --> 00:09:46.320
That's why you couldn't die?

00:09:47.290 --> 00:09:49.070
That's not the only reason.

00:09:52.000 --> 00:09:56.060
To maintain the forces required
to continue the battle,

00:09:57.250 --> 00:10:00.940
I must use a Giou technique

00:10:00.940 --> 00:10:06.050
to deliberately reincarnate
you and the Zweilts.

00:10:06.050 --> 00:10:08.930
To deliberately reincarnate us?

00:10:09.910 --> 00:10:14.890
In order to return you to
a new era of conflict,

00:10:14.890 --> 00:10:20.740
I must forcibly return your souls
to a world of pain and suffering,

00:10:20.740 --> 00:10:23.160
where you are reborn.

00:10:24.860 --> 00:10:27.610
I do this to destroy every last Duras

00:10:27.610 --> 00:10:32.730
and stop this endless battle.

00:10:37.300 --> 00:10:41.970
Is that why you've continued to live?

00:10:42.780 --> 00:10:46.190
I've lied many times to achieve my goal.

00:10:46.990 --> 00:10:50.010
Yuki, I've lied to you.

00:10:51.230 --> 00:10:55.390
I am not your brother.

00:10:59.320 --> 00:11:05.560
I didn't want to confuse you with memories
of a past you couldn't recall.

00:11:07.770 --> 00:11:10.780
No, that's just an excuse...

00:11:12.740 --> 00:11:15.490
It was a vile plan.

00:11:15.490 --> 00:11:17.890
I thought you would open
up to me more quickly

00:11:17.890 --> 00:11:20.330
if I claimed to be a relative.

00:11:20.330 --> 00:11:25.590
I thought it would facilitate
my taking you in.

00:11:27.810 --> 00:11:34.010
All I've done is think of ways to use
God's Light and the Zweilts,

00:11:35.340 --> 00:11:38.560
like they were simply tools.

00:11:41.630 --> 00:11:43.370
You must despise me.

00:11:50.610 --> 00:11:55.070
You've been carrying this
burden alone, for us.

00:12:03.560 --> 00:12:25.020
I'm sorry.

00:12:41.930 --> 00:12:43.910
Yuki!

00:12:43.910 --> 00:12:44.790
Sodom.

00:12:44.980 --> 00:12:46.450
Are you okay?

00:12:46.450 --> 00:12:47.830
Yuki, are you okay?

00:12:48.400 --> 00:12:49.730
I'm fine.

00:12:51.220 --> 00:12:53.260
This is Luka's familiar.

00:12:56.540 --> 00:12:57.930
Takashiro-san...

00:12:59.800 --> 00:13:03.310
Even if you aren't actually my brother,

00:13:03.310 --> 00:13:10.320
you're still very important to me.

00:13:11.560 --> 00:13:12.600
Yuki...

00:13:13.710 --> 00:13:17.160
Yuki, were you crying just now?

00:13:17.160 --> 00:13:18.740
Of course not.

00:13:18.740 --> 00:13:20.490
Really?

00:13:20.490 --> 00:13:21.830
Really.

00:13:21.830 --> 00:13:22.900
Yuki.

00:13:22.900 --> 00:13:23.660
Yes?

00:13:23.660 --> 00:13:26.250
I got caught up in our conversation.

00:13:27.520 --> 00:13:29.030
Let's hurry.

00:13:31.890 --> 00:13:34.130
There's something I want
to show you.

00:13:38.180 --> 00:13:40.010
What do you think?

00:13:41.140 --> 00:13:42.490
About what?

00:13:42.490 --> 00:13:46.990
About Takashiro-sama! The second
I finally got to meet Yuki,

00:13:46.990 --> 00:13:48.940
he took him away from me.

00:13:48.940 --> 00:13:51.600
"Took him away from you?"

00:13:51.600 --> 00:13:57.030
What do you expect?
Yuki-kun's not here to play.

00:13:57.560 --> 00:13:59.060
I know!

00:13:59.060 --> 00:14:04.700
That's why I wanted to do
something fun for him...

00:14:08.310 --> 00:14:11.870
Do you think Yuki will choose ignorance?

00:14:17.190 --> 00:14:18.340
What is this?

00:14:19.250 --> 00:14:21.030
God's Stone.

00:14:21.030 --> 00:14:26.220
It's the source of the Giou Clan's power.

00:14:26.220 --> 00:14:28.500
The source of our power...

00:14:32.270 --> 00:14:34.230
Wait for me!

00:14:40.350 --> 00:14:43.890
I must finish the fight I began.

00:14:47.080 --> 00:14:49.560
Even if it costs my life.

00:14:51.320 --> 00:14:56.500
Takashiro-san acts with
great determination.

00:15:02.990 --> 00:15:07.180
<i>I carry a Duras
inside my body.</i>

00:15:08.610 --> 00:15:14.680
He lives too recklessly.

00:15:21.360 --> 00:15:22.930
What...

00:15:22.930 --> 00:15:25.870
What drives you to act this way?

00:15:32.660 --> 00:15:40.580
This stone memorializes Zweilts
who have fallen in battle.

00:15:41.820 --> 00:15:44.360
For those Zweilts killed by Duras,

00:15:44.360 --> 00:15:49.180
their bodies and souls vanish
into nothingness.

00:15:49.180 --> 00:15:51.620
They cannot be reincarnated.

00:15:52.400 --> 00:15:53.810
They're not reborn?

00:15:53.810 --> 00:15:56.720
That is how Duras fight.

00:15:56.720 --> 00:15:59.520
They destroy souls.

00:15:59.520 --> 00:16:03.200
They have no mercy for their opponents.

00:16:04.770 --> 00:16:05.870
But why?

00:16:06.770 --> 00:16:12.830
Reiga does not believe humans
deserve to live.

00:16:19.230 --> 00:16:23.840
He's half-man, half-Duras.

00:16:29.140 --> 00:16:34.060
Our clan has possessed strange
powers since ancient times.

00:16:34.060 --> 00:16:38.430
People called us the descendants of God.

00:16:38.430 --> 00:16:41.610
But Reiga was different from the rest of us.

00:16:41.610 --> 00:16:47.530
He was born of a mother from the
Giou Clan and an Opast father.

00:16:47.530 --> 00:16:49.450
He was a taboo child.

00:16:53.630 --> 00:16:55.720
His power is enormous.

00:16:56.770 --> 00:17:03.020
All the Opasts we have defeated
in this thousand-year battle

00:17:03.020 --> 00:17:07.020
were summoned and controlled by him.

00:17:10.700 --> 00:17:16.680
Born to a detestable fate,
he came to hate humans.

00:17:16.680 --> 00:17:20.900
And he is trying to use his enormous
power to eradicate them.

00:17:21.420 --> 00:17:23.620
He is our enemy.

00:17:24.380 --> 00:17:27.320
<i>People betray people.</i>

00:17:31.290 --> 00:17:36.160
In this cycle of fate,
he found himself reborn

00:17:36.160 --> 00:17:41.850
as your acquaintance, Wakamiya Kanata.

00:17:43.170 --> 00:17:48.010
That he is Reiga's reincarnation
is beyond doubt.

00:17:49.300 --> 00:17:54.920
Until Reiga's powers fully develop,

00:17:54.920 --> 00:17:57.720
he conceals his identity,

00:17:57.720 --> 00:18:02.320
deceiving us by sealing away
his abilities and memories,

00:18:02.320 --> 00:18:05.620
posing as an ordinary human.

00:18:05.620 --> 00:18:09.580
So when I met Kanata-san, he...

00:18:10.490 --> 00:18:16.710
Yes. Born without Giou Reiga's memories,

00:18:16.710 --> 00:18:21.210
he met you when he still
existed as Wakamiya Kanata.

00:18:22.290 --> 00:18:27.840
There was nothing deceitful about
the Wakamiya Kanata you knew.

00:18:30.750 --> 00:18:36.100
It's even possible that Reiga,
through Wakamiya Kanata,

00:18:36.100 --> 00:18:40.130
was trying to believe in humanity.

00:18:46.420 --> 00:18:47.490
<i>Yuki.</i>

00:18:48.790 --> 00:18:50.090
<i>Kanata-san!</i>

00:18:50.860 --> 00:18:52.410
<i>Welcome home.</i>

00:18:53.110 --> 00:18:54.740
<i>Were you waiting for me here?</i>

00:18:57.060 --> 00:18:58.220
<i>Thank you.</i>

00:19:00.890 --> 00:19:03.070
<i>I'm home, Yuki.</i>

00:19:14.100 --> 00:19:15.470
<i>Yuki...</i>

00:19:16.380 --> 00:19:17.910
<i>Can't sleep?</i>

00:19:20.460 --> 00:19:21.770
<i>Do you want to sleep in my room?</i>

00:19:33.200 --> 00:19:39.510
<i>Yuki, it's okay to cry when it hurts.</i>

00:19:41.620 --> 00:19:46.680
<i>Your tears will wash away
your pain and sadness.</i>

00:19:47.580 --> 00:19:48.800
<i>Really?</i>

00:19:48.800 --> 00:19:53.210
<i>If that doesn't work, come see me.</i>

00:19:54.140 --> 00:19:59.460
<i>When you're sad or hurting,
I'll take care of you.</i>

00:19:59.460 --> 00:20:03.560
<i>I'll stay with you until
you can smile again.</i>

00:20:11.990 --> 00:20:13.290
Kanata-san...

00:20:22.270 --> 00:20:23.690
Yuki...

00:20:26.610 --> 00:20:27.850
It's okay.

00:20:29.370 --> 00:20:32.260
I won't cry any more.

00:20:33.360 --> 00:20:39.060
Fleeting, precious, loving...

00:20:40.840 --> 00:20:42.180
Takashiro-san.

00:20:43.180 --> 00:20:45.250
Tell me...

00:20:46.130 --> 00:20:49.550
Tell me why Reiga is consumed by hate...

00:20:50.540 --> 00:20:54.030
Why he betrayed his family.

00:20:55.830 --> 00:21:02.340
Upon the Setting of Taurus,
what did he do?

00:21:19.160 --> 00:21:20.720
You're alive.

00:21:22.650 --> 00:21:25.890
Let me go, Reiga-sama...

00:21:25.890 --> 00:21:31.190
Command me to kill them!

00:21:38.720 --> 00:21:40.320
That's it...

00:21:42.590 --> 00:21:44.160
<i>Hate them.</i>

00:21:56.150 --> 00:21:59.160
I will end it all in this battle.

00:22:00.750 --> 00:22:02.290
I will do it.

00:23:35.840 --> 00:23:37.740
Yuki-chan, let's play cards.

00:23:37.740 --> 00:23:39.850
Sure, but why so suddenly?

00:23:39.850 --> 00:23:43.700
I've been playing with Shusei,
but I just can't beat him.

00:23:43.700 --> 00:23:45.870
Oh, because of his God's Eyes.

00:23:45.870 --> 00:23:46.130
Shusei is relentless.

00:23:46.130 --> 00:23:47.870
Sakura

00:23:47.870 --> 00:23:49.270
He certainly is.

00:23:49.270 --> 00:23:49.940
Sakura
